WEBVTT

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:19.830
First a Link 3 monster, then a Link 
4 monster and another with 4300 ATK.

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:22.600
So that's what you two can do!

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:24.260
Here I go!

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:26.490
General's effect activates!

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:30.730
I Special Summon Scud Drone from 
the graveyard next to its link!

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:34.610
Scud Drone's effect activates!

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.120
When a Drone Special Summons it from 
the graveyard, I draw one card!

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:44.560
I set one card!

00:00:45.490 --> 00:00:47.830
General's effect activates!

00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:52.060
Due to its effect, Scud Drone 
can attack you directly!

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:56.660
Battle!  Scud Drone attacks you directly!

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:03.540
Then General's effect activates!

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:09.010
I tribute the Drone that attacked you 
directly to deal you damage equal to its ATK!

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:24.670
calling & feeling  I take your 
thoughts to heart  VRAINS

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:52.630
The data storm grazes my cheek, 
so I can't open my eyes

00:01:53.270 --> 00:02:02.580
What are we trying to find?  
Where are we trying to go?

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:07.820
I won't make anyone sad anymore

00:02:08.150 --> 00:02:16.360
I'll retrieve you  Let's go and look ahead

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:21.500
By meeting you, the world is in color

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:27.180
I'll protect you with an unseen bond

00:02:27.470 --> 00:02:31.480
calling  With invisible wings

00:02:31.770 --> 00:02:42.090
Destroy the dark and weakness within me

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:54.850
They now have more LP than me.

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:58.820
But I'll still try my best!

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:02.560
Impressive, Ghost Girl.

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:07.270
You've mastered your tag partner's cards.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:09.630
Thank you.

00:03:09.630 --> 00:03:13.560
Next, I want Hexstia to attack Celtopus...

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:17.180
But I can't right now.

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:20.680
In that case, Hexstia attacks Vacculephant!

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:24.120
Celtopus's effect!

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:29.750
When it battles, Vacculephant gains 2000 ATK!

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:30.760
That's pointless!

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:33.830
Hexstia has 4300 ATK!

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:35.560
It can't be stopped!

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:39.160
This is where I have to try hard!

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:41.570
Propelion's effect activates!

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:47.540
Once per turn, when it's co-linked, 
your monster's ATK are halved!

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:53.210
Strike back!

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:05.360
I did it!

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:09.090
I'm awesome!  I did it!

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:14.100
Not bad.

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:15.770
Don't hold back, Emma.

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:20.310
Duel your own duel.

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:23.720
Okay, Brother.

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:26.410
Hexstia's effect activates!

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:31.220
When it's sent to the graveyard, I 
add Kunquery from my deck to my hand.

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:33.990
Brother, I'm using your monster.

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:35.490
Do what you want.

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:40.260
I tribute General to activate 
Memorygant's effect!

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:44.960
It gains General's ATK.

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:48.070
What?  5200?

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:51.170
Memorygant attacks Vacculephant!

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:53.170
Celtopus's effect!

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:55.020
Octopus Charge!

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:59.650
But it's still less than Memorygant.

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:02.000
Go, Memorygant!

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:04.940
Eternal Nightmare!

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:13.570
Wow, Ghost Girl!

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:15.380
She made a comeback!

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:21.290
Yeah.  The key to a tag duel is 
whether you can trust each other.

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:24.070
It takes advantage of their bond.

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:27.330
Now Memorygant's effect activates!

00:05:27.330 --> 00:05:32.300
When it destroys a monster in battle, 
one of your monsters is destroyed.

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:35.050
I destroy Propelion!

00:05:38.490 --> 00:05:41.160
Next, I attack Celtopus.

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:46.120
But Ghost Girl, you've 
used up all your attacks.

00:05:46.760 --> 00:05:48.650
You're wrong.

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:55.700
When Memorygant's effect destroys 
a monster, it can attack again.

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:59.310
That effect is crazy!

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:04.890
She tributed General and raised 
its attack to use this effect.

00:06:04.890 --> 00:06:06.880
Sorry, Roboppi.

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:09.980
You just fought the wrong opponents.

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:11.960
Go, Memorygant!

00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:14.390
Eternal Nightmare!

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:20.320
Impressive.  But I'm not giving up!

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:24.920
I activate Appliancer Breakerbuncle's 
effect from my hand!

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:31.170
By sending it to the graveyard, Celtopus 
isn't destroyed, and damage becomes 0.

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:36.680
He survived the attack?

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:39.910
I end my turn.

00:06:39.910 --> 00:06:43.690
Hooray!  I escaped the pinch!

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:48.210
Now Memorygant's ATK return to normal!

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:51.940
But you have 0 cards in your hand.

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:55.130
We still have a huge advantage in this duel.

00:06:55.130 --> 00:06:56.290
I'm so happy-

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:01.030
You're right.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:04.040
But I may get lucky!

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:07.910
I'll bet everything on the next draw!

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:11.180
Come, my card of destiny!

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:13.210
My turn!

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:17.840
Here it is!

00:07:17.840 --> 00:07:22.490
First, I activate the spell 
card, Appliancer Test!

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:27.060
I Special Summon Link 1 
Appliancers from my graveyard...

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:32.960
...so that they're co-linked with the 
monster in the Extra Monster Zone!

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:36.780
Resurrect, Vacculephant and Propelion!

00:07:36.780 --> 00:07:41.410
But their ATK become 0, and they're 
banished at the end of the turn.

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:46.340
I use Propelion to Link Summon!

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:51.410
Link 1 Appliancer Laundry Dragon!

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:58.780
He used it to summon another Link 1 monster.

00:07:58.780 --> 00:08:00.560
He's up to something.

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:03.100
Impressive, Blood Shepherd!

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:05.300
Vacculephant's effect.

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:10.270
When it's co-linked, one of 
your monsters is destroyed.

00:08:10.270 --> 00:08:14.250
I select Memorygant!

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:21.710
Memorygant's effect!

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:27.190
When Memorygant will be destroyed, I can 
banish General from the graveyard instead.

00:08:27.620 --> 00:08:29.680
So that's your move!

00:08:29.680 --> 00:08:33.040
Then I'll attack with Laundry Dragon!

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:37.940
Attack using a monster with lower ATK?

00:08:37.940 --> 00:08:41.930
When Laundry Dragon battles 
while it's co-linked...

00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:47.770
...we both take 0 damage, and 
your monster is banished!

00:08:48.740 --> 00:08:50.770
First destruction, now banish?

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:52.580
How annoying.

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:55.080
Bye, Memorygant!

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:58.710
I activate Kunquery's effect from my hand!

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:02.480
It Special Summons itself 
and negates the attack!

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:06.220
And it negates one card's effects!

00:09:09.810 --> 00:09:14.170
But I still have the card 
of destiny I just drew.

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:17.800
I activate the Quick-Play 
Spell, Appliancer Conversion!

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:23.170
I banish all Link 1 Appliancers 
in the Main Monster Zone!

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:28.120
And I Special Summon the banished 
Appliancer Link Monsters!

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:31.330
He brought out his banished monsters?

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:36.080
Is he going to use Laundry 
Dragon's effect again?

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:37.120
No.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:42.490
Laundry Dragon can't use its 
effect unless it's co-linked.

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:47.700
The two monsters' positions have changed.

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:52.940
If they're not co-linked, 
Celtopus can't affect them.

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:54.700
So why?

00:09:56.660 --> 00:09:59.540
I'll tell you the answer.

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:06.030
Appliancers have different effects, 
depending on whether they're co-linked or not!

00:10:07.210 --> 00:10:09.350
First, Vacculephant!

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:13.530
When it's not co-linked, 
it can attack you directly.

00:10:13.530 --> 00:10:14.610
Here I go!

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:17.580
Vacculephant attacks you directly!

00:10:21.230 --> 00:10:25.940
Next, Laundry Dragon attacks Memorygant!

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:27.460
Ghost Girl!

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:29.910
Please use your Skill.

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:33.650
I sense he's plotting something huge.

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:37.280
Okay.  I'll trust you.

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:41.800
I activate my Skill!  Secret Cure!

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:47.630
We both regain LP equal to 
the ATK of the monster I get!

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:53.220
I drew Marionetter!

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:57.070
We regain 1600 LP!

00:10:58.240 --> 00:11:00.910
So you were on guard for this attack.

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:05.170
But too bad.  It's already over!

00:11:05.170 --> 00:11:07.880
Laundry Dragon's effect activates!

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:13.350
When it's not co-linked, 
battle damage becomes 0.

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:20.360
And your battling monster is destroyed, and 
you take damage equal to its original ATK!

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:24.200
Oh no!  You can't withstand that damage!

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:27.670
Go, Laundry Dragon!

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:33.880
Memorygant is destroyed.

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:37.960
You take 2800 damage!

00:11:40.370 --> 00:11:42.120
Move, Emma!

00:11:45.480 --> 00:11:46.850
Brother...

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:52.580
You freed me from my prison of hate.

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:54.480
Thank you.

00:11:57.220 --> 00:11:59.500
Sorry, Brother.

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:01.800
We lost.

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:04.040
Emma...

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:06.480
Brother...

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:19.100
I don't fully understand, 
but I saw something good.

00:12:19.100 --> 00:12:23.020
I'll let Bro know of these emotions!

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:29.790
Emma!  Blood Shepherd!

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:33.530
No way...  Emma was...

00:12:33.530 --> 00:12:35.270
Not just them two!

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:37.500
Faust and Spectre were also defeated!

00:12:38.460 --> 00:12:42.050
That only leaves Go Onizuka.

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:44.420
We're in bad shape!

00:12:44.420 --> 00:12:46.540
Hurry, Playmaker!

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:49.780
I know.  But...

00:12:50.210 --> 00:12:51.760
What's wrong?

00:12:51.760 --> 00:12:55.060
If you don't hurry, you'll be too late.

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:59.820
But you can't break my lock that easily.

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:07.580
Seems you're the real Ai!

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:09.630
I'll stop you!

00:13:09.940 --> 00:13:11.940
Hey, Go Onizuka!

00:13:11.940 --> 00:13:14.060
I'm glad you're alive!

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:19.080
I can finally get revenge for Earth.

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:24.050
You sped up the war between humans and Ignis.

00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:28.980
If it wasn't for you, Earth 
wouldn't have been sacrificed.

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:31.860
I can't agree with that statement.

00:13:32.800 --> 00:13:39.140
According to our analysis, odds are 100% 
that Bohman would've absorbed Earth.

00:13:39.140 --> 00:13:40.750
What are you?

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:43.600
I'm Pandor.  Nice to meet you.

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:46.600
An anti-Ignis AI.

00:13:46.600 --> 00:13:50.620
You're new, so don't talk 
like you know everything!

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:56.500
Go Onizuka, wasn't the chip 
embedded in your head enough?

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:58.520
The chip was removed.

00:13:59.760 --> 00:14:05.520
My choice to fuse with an AI was wrong.

00:14:06.560 --> 00:14:11.700
After I lost to you, I wandered 
the border between life and death.

00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:15.770
When I woke up...

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:21.570
The tears of children were waiting for me.

00:14:22.510 --> 00:14:26.820
For my lame pride, I abandoned them.

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:31.260
But they kept waiting for me to come home.

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:37.660
Thanks to them, I was able 
to rediscover myself.

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:41.930
No matter how many times I fall, 
I'll keep standing back up!

00:14:41.930 --> 00:14:46.730
And I'll keep going home to 
those who believed in me!

00:14:46.730 --> 00:14:49.630
That's the real Go Onizuka!

00:14:50.800 --> 00:14:55.640
Ai, your goal will endanger children!

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:58.110
I won't allow that!

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:03.440
I like your style, Onizuka.

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:07.170
I like how you are now than before.

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:10.210
Make sure to entertain me!

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:11.890
Duel!

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:16.230
I'll go first!

00:15:16.230 --> 00:15:19.850
I summon Gouki Suprex!

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:26.470
A Gouki Deck?

00:15:26.470 --> 00:15:32.480
When I was on the verge of death, I 
realized what deck I should be playing!

00:15:32.480 --> 00:15:35.030
I activate Suprex's effect!

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:38.620
I Special Summon Riscorpio from my hand!

00:15:39.920 --> 00:15:43.120
Appear!  The circuit of fortitude!

00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:46.520
Link Summon!

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:50.900
Link 2 Gouki Jet Ogre!

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:56.600
Suprex and Riscorpio went to the 
graveyard, so their effects activate!

00:15:56.600 --> 00:16:00.340
I add Gouki cards in my deck to my hand.

00:16:01.650 --> 00:16:05.130
I activate Gouki Re-Match!

00:16:05.820 --> 00:16:10.010
I Special Summon Suprex and 
Riscorpio from my graveyard!

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:15.950
Then I Link Summon!

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:21.990
Link 3 Gouki Thunder Ogre!

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:27.700
Thunder Ogre's effect!

00:16:28.240 --> 00:16:32.330
I can summon again next to its link.

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:35.260
Appear, Suprex!

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:39.540
Suprex's effect activates again!

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:43.510
I Special Summon Twistcobra from my hand!

00:16:43.510 --> 00:16:47.320
Appear again!  The circuit of fortitude!

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:53.430
I set Twistcobra and Link 3 
Thunder Ogre in the Link Markers!

00:16:53.430 --> 00:16:55.260
Link Summon.

00:16:55.260 --> 00:17:00.890
Appear, Link 4 Gouki The Master Ogre!

00:17:02.230 --> 00:17:06.700
Twistcobra's effect activates 
when it's sent to the graveyard.

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:09.440
I add a Gouki card to my hand.

00:17:09.740 --> 00:17:12.410
I end my turn.

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:14.900
You already have a Link 4.

00:17:14.900 --> 00:17:17.620
Your skills haven't atrophied.

00:17:17.620 --> 00:17:20.420
So this is your real deck.

00:17:21.610 --> 00:17:23.910
It's worth crushing.

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:26.860
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:26.860 --> 00:17:30.590
I summon Pikari @Ignister from my hand!

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:35.640
Pikari's effect activates.

00:17:35.640 --> 00:17:40.940
When it's summoned, I can add Ignister 
AiLand from my deck to my hand.

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:42.640
I won't let you!

00:17:42.640 --> 00:17:44.980
Master Ogre's effect activates!

00:17:45.360 --> 00:17:49.060
I can return Goukis next 
to its links to my hand...

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:53.980
...to negate the same number of 
cards until the end of the turn!

00:17:53.980 --> 00:17:56.870
I return Suprex to my hand!

00:17:56.870 --> 00:17:59.690
Pikari's effects are negated!

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:04.920
We've already shared your duel data among us.

00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:09.670
I see.  Then I'll attack 
using a different strategy!

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:12.400
Link Summon!

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:14.620
Appear, Linguriboh!

00:18:16.580 --> 00:18:20.140
I activate Hiyari @Ignister's 
effect from my hand!

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:27.140
When my Link Monster is in the Extra Monster 
Zone, I can Special Summon it next to its link!

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:29.520
Appear, Hiyari!

00:18:32.260 --> 00:18:36.820
I activate Doshin @Ignister's 
effect from my hand!

00:18:36.820 --> 00:18:41.780
When an @Ignister is in the Main 
Monster Zone, I can Special Summon it!

00:18:41.780 --> 00:18:43.770
Come, Doshin!

00:18:46.340 --> 00:18:51.310
I set Doshin, Hiyari and 
Linguriboh in the Link Markers!

00:18:53.060 --> 00:18:55.080
The creation of dark shadows!

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:58.320
The wisdom of the dark night 
scatters throughout the world!

00:18:58.320 --> 00:19:02.050
Gathers in my hand to become 
the power of rising vigor!

00:19:02.050 --> 00:19:03.540
Link Summon!

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:09.160
Appear, Link 3 Dark Templar @Ignister!

00:19:13.020 --> 00:19:17.470
He did all this without Ignister AiLand!

00:19:17.470 --> 00:19:20.940
I set one card.

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:27.650
Battle!  Dark Templar attacks Master Ogre!

00:19:27.650 --> 00:19:30.150
What?  Why?

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:34.550
Dark Templar has less ATK than Master Ogre.

00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:39.620
What will you do, Go Onizuka?

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:44.690
I don't know what you're planning, 
but I'll still annihilate you!

00:19:44.690 --> 00:19:48.850
I activate Gouki Iron Claw's 
effect from my hand!

00:19:49.490 --> 00:19:54.860
By sending it to the graveyard, 
Master Ogre gains 500 ATK!

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:59.280
Master Ogre isn't affected 
by your effects this turn!

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:02.060
Go, Master Ogre!

00:20:02.410 --> 00:20:03.780
Not good enough!

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:07.250
I activate the Quick-Play Spell, 
TAi Strike from my hand!

00:20:07.940 --> 00:20:14.480
It makes an @Ignister's ATK the 
same as the monster it's battling!

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:24.580
And we both take damage equal to the 
original ATK of their own destroyed monsters.

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:27.270
You're willing to take damage too?

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:43.640
What?  Why is Dark Templar okay?

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:49.160
Too bad.  Dark Templar can't 
be mutually destroyed.

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:55.170
Remember this.  I'll beat you up one-sidedly.

00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:57.950
That's how Ai will strike you.

00:20:57.950 --> 00:21:00.400
Dark Templar's effect activates!

00:21:01.010 --> 00:21:03.860
When it destroys your monster in battle...

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:08.650
...I Special Summon an @Ignister 
from my graveyard next to its link.

00:21:08.650 --> 00:21:10.560
Resurrect, Pikari!

00:21:12.850 --> 00:21:15.440
Dark Templar's effect.

00:21:15.440 --> 00:21:18.970
When a monster is Special 
Summoned next to its link...

00:21:18.970 --> 00:21:23.570
...I Special Summon as many Level 4
 or lower @Ignisters as possible from

00:21:23.570 --> 00:21:25.940
my graveyard by negating their effects.

00:21:26.310 --> 00:21:28.300
Resurrect, Doshin!

00:21:30.300 --> 00:21:33.300
Then Pikari's effect activates.

00:21:33.300 --> 00:21:37.050
I add Ignister AiLand 
from my deck to my hand.

00:21:37.050 --> 00:21:39.780
I end my turn.

00:21:41.140 --> 00:21:44.050
Go Onizuka, just give up.

00:21:44.050 --> 00:21:46.200
No, I won't give up.

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:49.950
There are children waiting for me.

00:21:50.320 --> 00:21:52.480
I'm Go Onizuka.

00:21:53.320 --> 00:21:57.390
I'll keep standing back up!

00:21:59.360 --> 00:22:03.040
My turn!  I draw!

00:22:05.550 --> 00:22:09.520
I was told repeatedly

00:22:09.520 --> 00:22:16.970
Only tales of dreams

00:22:17.320 --> 00:22:23.940
Is my life precious?

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:26.940
Make up for  Make up for

00:22:27.300 --> 00:22:34.450
The next sentimental

00:22:39.280 --> 00:22:45.700
I'm not a machine

00:22:48.420 --> 00:22:52.140
I cry a single tear

00:22:53.630 --> 00:22:57.370
A single answer moves me

00:22:58.530 --> 00:23:07.720
We helplessly sing for someone we can't reach

00:23:08.340 --> 00:23:13.150
Are you ready?

00:23:13.650 --> 00:23:18.500
Oh oh oh

00:23:19.020 --> 00:23:23.730
Are you ready?

00:23:24.320 --> 00:23:30.810
Are you ready?

00:23:37.740 --> 00:23:41.660
The strong use defeats to grow.

00:23:41.660 --> 00:23:47.840
Among those who give up and don't try to 
stand up again, the strong keep trying.

00:23:47.840 --> 00:23:52.510
There is now one who walks that path.

00:23:52.510 --> 00:23:56.540
Yes.  His name is Go Onizuka!

00:23:56.540 --> 00:23:59.750
The man who will keep standing back up!

00:23:59.750 --> 00:24:04.010
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Indomitable Spirit

00:24:04.010 --> 00:24:06.180
Into the VRAINS!
